{"slug":"Practice/Python/260730-rate-limiter-bug/note","title":"연습 — RateLimiter 버그 찾기","tags":[],"updated":"2026-09-18T15:07:27+09:00","minutes":2,"html":"<ul>\n<li>문제: <code>problem.py</code>의 <code>RateLimiter</code>가 윈도우당 허용해야 할 요청 수보다 <strong>하나 더 많이</strong> 통과시킨다.</li>\n<li>유형: 디버깅</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"재현\">재현</h2>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">rl </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RateLimiter(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max_requests</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">window_seconds</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">results </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [rl.allow(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"u1\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, t) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(results)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 기대: [True, True, True, False]  (3개까지만 허용)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 실제: ?</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>직접 <code>python problem.py</code>로 실행해서 실제 출력을 확인해보세요.</p>\n<h2 id=\"진행-방법\">진행 방법</h2>\n<p>디버깅 루틴을 따라 아래 순서로 풀어보세요. AI 도구 없이 먼저 시도할 것.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>재현 — 위 코드를 실행해서 실제로 몇 번째 요청까지 허용되는지 확인</li>\n<li>가설 — 어느 줄이 문제인지 문장으로 적기</li>\n<li>검증 — 그 줄만 격리해서 확인, 수정 후 재실행</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"접근\">접근</h2>\n<p>(직접 풀면서 여기에 기록)</p>\n<ol>\n<li>실제실행시 [True, True, True, True]로 4개의 True가 반환됨.\n하지만 실제로는 max_requests가 3이기 때문에 4번째 timestamp가 3으로 입력 될 때는 false가 출력되어야 함.</li>\n<li>16번째 줄이 문제라고 파악됨. 그 이유는 16번째 줄에서 이미 history 내에 request가 3개가 되었을때그만되어야 하는데, 3개 이하라는 &#x3C;= 조건이 하나를 더 허용하게 해주는문제가 있음</li>\n<li>해당 사항 수정시, 아래와 같이 결과가 수정됨</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">python</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./problem.py</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[True, True, True, False]</span></span></code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"관련-개념\">관련 개념</h2>\n<h2 id=\"회고\">회고</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>테스트용 문제이지만, 우선 파이썬의 기본 문법에 취약하다는 점을 파악할 수 있었음</li>\n<li>로직 정합성에 대한 연습은 지금처럼 점차 난이도를 올려가는 것이 좋을 것 같음</li>\n</ul>","toc":[{"depth":2,"id":"재현","text":"재현"},{"depth":2,"id":"진행-방법","text":"진행 방법"},{"depth":2,"id":"접근","text":"접근"},{"depth":2,"id":"관련-개념","text":"관련 개념"},{"depth":2,"id":"회고","text":"회고"}],"backlinks":[]}